Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: wordpad: Scale the format bar, ruler, print preview and default window size to the DPI.
 The main toolbar has standard images, which comctl32 enlarges by a whole
 factor; give the format bar images of the same size. Scale the font and
 size combo boxes, the ruler, the print preview bar and the default
 window size to the screen DPI.
